  "training": "Sixteen new independent stock credits of the five-title PPO teacher. Eight Hard/eight Lunatic, four per difficulty per lane. No prior test game enters the optimizer. Require true nonzero PPO critic, all four unscripted policy heads and independent full reforward before admission.",
  "evaluation": "After both descendants of the same parent are frozen, compare the five-title 188 update against the six-title 189 update on 32 new same-host, same-lane seeds. Each difficulty by lane has eight pairs, four candidate-first. Wait for weights without treating elapsed time as an endpoint. Native Stage 2 arrival is the primary endpoint, last spare lives/Bombs, first observed loss and credited duration are secondary.",
